    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the sentiment but it doesnt feel like that. it feels more like... math. i'm taking up space, energy, and time in a system that has moved past my utility. if a part of a machine is no longer functional and just causes friction, the logical thing is to remove it. it's hard to feel like a \"survivor\" when you feel like you're just an error in the code of the modern world.",
